issue_context.body:
I'm trying the blinky_pwm sample for the teensy4 using the onboard LED. I've added an dt overlay to add the pwm bits which look like:
```
/ {
	pwmleds {
		compatible = "pwm-leds";
		external_pwm_led: external_pwm_led {
			pwms = <&flexpwm1_pwm1 0>;
		};
	};

	aliases {
		pwm-led0 = &external_pwm_led;
	};
};

&flexpwm1_pwm1 {
	status = "okay";
};
```

But i'm getting the following error on the console:

```
*** Booting Zephyr OS build v2.7.0-rc2-54-g2160e0fc364d  ***
